lhead-trout-thanksgiving-stuffing-recipe\">Get the recipe<\/a><\/p>","color_text":"#ffffff","color_background":"#171717"}},"profile_tPnk6G":{"type":"profile","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2025-05-22_at_12.59.47_PM.png","heading":"Butterflied Broiled Trout","text":"<p>Join us in preparing a perfectly broiled Butterflied Rainbow Trout, a flavorful recipe.  Watch the full video below to learn how to debone the fish using the Butterfly technique and then broil the fish to create the perfect crispy skin.  We serve it over a vibrant sauce made from roasted poblano peppers, cilantro, lemon juice, olive oil, anchovies, and nori. This dish brings out the best in sustainable seafood, highlighting the natural flavors of the ocean with a zesty twist.<\/p><p>👉🏽 <a href=\"https:\/\/seatopia.fish\/blogs\/seafood-recipes\/broiled-butterfly-rainbow-trout\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/seatopia.fish\/blogs\/seafood-recipes\/broiled-butterfly-rainbow-trout\">Get the recipe<\/a><\/p>","color_text":"#ffffff","color_background":"#171717"}}},"block_order":["profile_FtXEVP","profile_9abkc4","profile_tPnk6G"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":["\/* Center the tiles inside the grid *\/.portfolio.card-grid {display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 2rem; padding: 1rem; text-align: center;}"," \/* Optional: center the parent container if needed *\/.card-grid--4 {justify-content: center;}",".grid {justify-content: center;}",".profile.card {max-width: clamp(250px, 25vw, 300px); width: 100%;}"],"settings":{"columns":4,"carousel_on_desktop":false,"layout":"default","image_ratio":"portrait","image_ratio_mobile":"portrait","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":true,"heading":"Rainbow Trout Recipes","heading_size":"title-md","heading_alignment":"text-center justify-center","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"c